                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EHigher Education\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Ch1\u003ECity College of San Francisco\u003C\/h1\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECreating a unified digital experience for the university meant eliminating fragmented systems and establishing a single source of truth. By integrating course data directly into the website, we streamlined content management, improved accuracy, and made it easier for students and faculty to access up-to-date information. The result is a cohesive, user-friendly platform that brings clarity and consistency to the university\u2019s academic offerings.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022button transparent\u0022 href=\u0022https:\/\/www.ccsf.edu\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 tabindex=\u00220\u0022\u003EView Website\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
