                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EMy Role\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003ELead Developer responsible for guiding a team of five developers through the planning, architecture, and implementation of a large-scale university website enhancement project. Served as the primary technical liaison between the agency team and university stakeholders, providing technical direction, code reviews, and solution planning.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
