                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "180",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EApproach\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e347db02c7b145a9a29fb76818812716f\u0022\u003ELed development efforts to create structured content systems for events, news, and academic information.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022ec05051724ea578aca2acf0ba98b33dba\u0022\u003EIntegrated the website with the university\u2019s single source of truth through APIs to ensure accurate and synchronized course data.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e7dff2482a295d05082f9c2b8cbcd4438\u0022\u003ECollaborated with designers and stakeholders to translate user needs into scalable technical solutions.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e70d07754d5b91d23f790b32301eedbd3\u0022\u003EGuided a team of developers through implementation, code standards, and project delivery.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "183",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": ["col-lg-4"],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "182",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EKey Wins\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e419a42c30d7c45bfe4032ac6607513bc\u0022\u003EDeveloped a robust events calendar and newsroom experience that improved content organization and discovery.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e89887c5d997bc11779174dc0f54f43b4\u0022\u003EBuilt an advanced course search platform connected directly to university systems through API integrations.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022eb38c39c9bec3fe157c5415a01d8fd61e\u0022\u003ECreated a custom Google Maps experience featuring a 3D campus image overlay for an immersive campus exploration experience.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e006915ecbe8bcbf73e37b1a2193adcb6\u0022\u003EEstablished reusable development patterns and technical solutions to support future platform growth.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
