                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EOutcome\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EDelivered a modern, user-focused university website experience that improved access to academic and campus information while creating a flexible foundation for future enhancements. The project strengthened the institution\u2019s digital presence through better integrations, improved usability, and scalable architecture.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
